From: davmels <davmelous@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Save logprob-offloaded optimizer state from CPU

Adapt RL-infra's NeMo-RL patch 0007 without its referrer diagnostics or
checkpoint-GC dependency. When optimizer state is saved and normally offloaded
for logprobs, keep it on CPU during the save. prepare_for_training restores it
to CUDA before the next update. Hybrid CPU-offloaded optimizers are unchanged.

--- a/nemo_rl/models/policy/workers/megatron_policy_worker.py
+++ b/nemo_rl/models/policy/workers/megatron_policy_worker.py
@@ -4616,7 +4616,10 @@
                 and self.optimizer is not None
                 and not self.optimizer_cpu_offload
             ):
-                self.move_optimizer("cuda")
+                # Avoid retaining GPU optimizer-state copies across checkpoint saves.
+                self.move_optimizer(
+                    "cpu" if self.offload_optimizer_for_logprob else "cuda"
+                )
             torch.cuda.synchronize()
 
             self.mcore_state.cfg.checkpoint.save = weights_path
